# No Co-Authored-By / AI attribution

Never add AI or tool attribution to git commits or pull requests.

## Forbidden

- `Co-Authored-By:` trailers (Cursor, Claude, Codex, Copilot, or any other)
- "Generated with …", "Made with …", or similar attribution lines in commit messages or PR bodies

## Required

- Commit and PR text must contain only the human-facing summary of the change
- If a hook or tool injects `Co-Authored-By` / attribution, remove it before finishing (amend only when amend rules allow; otherwise rewrite the local commit message)

```text
# ❌ BAD
Prepare Flatpak packaging for Flathub app ID.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>

# ✅ GOOD
Prepare Flatpak packaging for Flathub app ID.
```
